<title>UK: TABLE-Kunick H1 pre-tax, pre-excep rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kunick H1 pre-tax, pre-excep rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		0.71		  vs  0.55</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.35		  vs  0.30</p>
<p> Pretax, pre-excep	4.5		   vs  4.0</p>
<p> Turnover		  64.9		   vs 58.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Leisure management group Kunick said it incurred 0.2 million of exceptional costs related to an aborted acquisition. The company said it was &quot;very positive&quot; about its growth prospects.</p>
<p>Full company name - Kunick Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
